&_nc_oc=Adq7sVrmbLdGodT8BKa1TUdKuBimUtfhmf2MH9mPU9jht0yXz6IS3j4a0cFsijErE0U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5TjiCpQJhOXHRgbvYDbEm-PihgaSVoYoEYUwCiBAp-UQ&oe=6A1467BE"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-3.png", "id": "1157916768541329", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566684_1157916771874662_3154846063092592377_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UwDsrYivDNYQ7kNvwGE7Ovp&_nc_oc=Adq2nH7xE5691c0LA6we3gWY-z5WqweE-AO2KmMOxfleXbKmq5K3maSl-mlN-dq6_Iw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5Fvi6MyBoOavEMP1WDbBp9BNGRBUliFQ4-OjFejeFpkQ&oe=6A14407C"}, {"file_name": "Flipside-Meta_Screenshot-4.png", "id": "503354952327839", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394163_503354955661172_3675385292904393650_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZbMnlvaSizAQ7kNvwElo5pT&_nc_oc=Adqf7neFlq3f9mh_4aBKW72KU4fu8HOK9Kgw3g_UbVXXTfLndSOKB4FDICt526ZvOng&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5dLZcpVSsSSooib-pZrY7c1cCThekFlTvtgikg2MnpCg&oe=6A145F07"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-5.png", "id": "377927191539358", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035465_377927194872691_2692247835418631299_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WH93FOtZVakQ7kNvwEg81Pt&_nc_oc=AdrOj61-eUY7sG23hGB63puQ2ivL2ffODrh2buualWcL1MF1yiNus5gArZbXA1bb8yQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4ltXTE7EQbz5zByrB94CPsVKJf14CVeoMXvgmRBclivQ&oe=6A144AD5"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "FS_Cover-Landscape.png", "id": "948055656716612", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001731_948055660049945_3697445677810051434_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=c_1SFgKafccQ7kNvwHCCnBL&_nc_oc=Adr0PSFmKxq-RiiTM41z9A4d3qs37KObOVYjFti6Gc6Ssj2R53CevEkknW0z0NvvjGc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5rgJX3BJi9_5p-bx1rc8EO-1-V3LMIQb_FnEKptTppcg&oe=6A145764"}, "display_name": "Flipside", "keywords": ["animation", "mocap", "recording", "metaverse", "social"], "long_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.\n\n# Highlights:\n\n- Browse, watch, like, share and subscribe to other Flipside creators\n- Remix other creators' posts, where you can replace characters with yourself\n- Send direct messages to connect with your friends and share content\n- Record full 3D spatial recordings, including motion capture, voice, props, music and more\n- An ever-growing catalog of built-in characters, props and sets\n- Generate custom characters with built-in Ready Player Me integration\n- Generate teleprompter scripts and custom sets using AI tools\n- Show tools including cameras, camera switcher, teleprompters, slideshow, and more\n- Audio controller to add music and special effects, including a built-in audio library or import your own\n- Use our companion Flipside Broadcaster app for PC to capture 2D content for other social platforms\n- Use our Flipside Creator Tools plugin for Unity to import your own custom characters, props, and sets\n- And too many features to list them all\n\nDownload Flipside today!", "short_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.